ring of checkpoints full, twice the model, plus the scenario twice), checked against lane H's measurements of real sessions and the plan's
10 m peaks; memoryBound.ts: the default of --max-session-mib. throttle.ts: a TCP proxy that holds each direction to a rate and a delay, with
backpressure. measureSession.ts and measure.mjs: what one session costs in memory.

